{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Companion to the Fancy Mapper Settings calibration section. Assign THIS script to your dial's clockwise shortcut. Each invocation increments the tick counter displayed in Settings. Requirements: REAPER 7.0+\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Nudges selected track(s) volume down by a configurable dB increment. Designed for hardware dials and rotary encoders that send rapid keyboard events. Includes timestamp-based throttling to prevent event queue buildup from causing runaway fader movement. Configure step size and throttle in Fancy Mapper Settings. Requirements: REAPER 7.0+\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Nudges selected track(s) volume up by a configurable dB increment. Designed for hardware dials and rotary encoders that send rapid keyboard events. Includes timestamp-based throttling to prevent event queue buildup from causing runaway fader movement. Configure step size and throttle in Fancy Mapper Settings. Requirements: REAPER 7.0+\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sets specified Send volume to match the Main Track Fader. Useful for copying your current Main Mix to a Pre-Fader Headphone Send.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Stops a running Fancy Tap Tempo Slew glide. The tempo stays where it is and the tap history is cleared, so the next tap starts fresh. Requirements: REAPER 7.03+\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Tap tempo for following a live player. After the 4th tap the tempo changes at once, or glides at a configurable slew rate. Bind the action to a key and press it on each beat. The target BPM is the average of the last few tap intervals. Use the "Fancy Tap Tempo Slew Settings" action to change the mode, taps per change and limits. An instant change inserts a tempo marker at the play position, so the play position does not jump and sounding notes are not retriggered. Requirements: REAPER 7.03+\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 \u55356 ?\u57243 ?\u65039 ? Fancy Scripts for REAPER\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b A collection of workflow-enhancing scripts for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reaper.fm/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
REAPER
}}}
 by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/TheFancyWolf"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
Fancy Wolf Audio
}}}
.}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/License-GPLv3-blue.svg]\cf0}
}}}
 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://reapack.com"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/ReaPack-Compatible-brightgreen.svg]\cf0}
}}}
\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56550 ? Installation via ReaPack\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The easiest way to install and stay updated:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab In REAPER, go to {\b Extensions > ReaPack > Import Repositories...}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Paste the following URL:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi0 \f1 https://github.com/TheFancyWolf/fancy-scripts/raw/main/index.xml\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Go to {\b Extensions > ReaPack > Browse Packages...}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab Search for {\b "Fancy"}, right-click \u8594 ? {\b Install}, and click {\b Apply}.\sa180\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55356 ?\u57242 ?\u65039 ? Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Fancy ParameterLink\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Link FX parameters between tracks with Follow or Inverse modes and adjustable strength. Full ReaImGui interface with shared pickers, auto group-scan, global presets, live inspector, and settings modal.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Requirements:} REAPER 7.0+, ReaImGui\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Fancy Selected Track Meter\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Real-time visual metering display for selected tracks with customizable colors, peak hold, and docking support.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Requirements:} REAPER 7.0+, ReaImGui\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Fancy Copy Fader to Send\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sets a Send volume to match the Main Track Fader. Useful for copying your Main Mix level to a Pre-Fader Headphone Send.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Requirements:} REAPER 7.0+\sa180\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56470 ? Support Development\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 If these scripts save you time, consider sponsoring development:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/sponsors/TheFancyWolf"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/Sponsor-%E2%9D%A4-pink?logo=github]\cf0}
}}}
\par}
